 "recognition_note": "The antigen is recognized as the HCMV pentamer (gL/UL128/UL130/UL131A/gH), but the supplied antibody and antigen-antibody pair are not recognized. Exact-CDR, RCSB-entity, patent, PC-series and paired-antibody searches did not identify it. Published complexes contain sequence-distinct antibodies and provide only Tier B precedent.",
